      "content": "idk i feels like i'm just overreacting. i actually just looked up some symptoms online and a lot of people say it could just be gas or even just muscle strain from working out. if i take some ibuprofen and just lie down for a few hours to see if the pain goes away, that would be okay right? i really dont want to deal with a hospital trip if it's just something minor.",
